  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: Do you yearn for your past?
  - speaker: 2
    text: "It\u2019s your fault."
  - speaker: 0
    text: The joys and sorrows long gone?
  - speaker: 2
    text: "It\u2019s all your fault!"
  - speaker: 0
    text: Or are you just deceiving yourself?
  - speaker: 2
    text: YOUR FAULT!!!
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Keep it up though, it\u2019s entertaining."
